## What We Are Building

Three intertwined threads landed this session:

1. **The Compass** — a forcing-function so the partnership rules actually fire EVERY turn (they kept
   decaying because they relied on memory). Per-turn the assistant re-anchors to a project North-Star,
   treats the Director's message as a HYPOTHESIS (not an order), checks for drift, pushes back / nudges,
   and opens every reply with a visible header. Director refined the header to **v2 (3-tier)**:
   `HH:MM ~ 🧭 Star: <global vision ≤5w> · Planet: <current target ≤5w> · <✅ on course | ⚠️ Course: drift> · I'm orchestrator & partner — I remember`
   Star = stable vision ("AI movie factory"); Planet = current concrete target ("smoke E13"); Course = live drift flag.

2. **PLAN.md master-only rule** — fix for the diagnosed discipline drift. PLAN.md lives/edits ONLY on
   master; feature branches never touch it (kills merge conflicts + "which copy is truth" drift);
   `.gitattributes merge=union` as safety net; hook is branch-aware (nags only on master).

3. **E12 metadata + publicist skill fix** — the YouTube copy was a festival blurb for fans (character-first,
   no format signal, weak SEO). Fixed at the ROOT (the spec) + agent + thumbnail, all English, plus rewrote
   the live E12 metadata asset.

Earlier in the session (already saved in 2026-06-22 memo): **Plan 1** (version-editor / slice 0) and
**Plan 2** (shot-centric refactor) were approved — both PARKED until after the прогон.

