## Decisions Made

- **Compass header v2** — Star (global vision) / Planet (current target) / Course (drift) + role line. Better
  than the 2-part because it separates global goal from current task (what Director originally asked).
- **PLAN.md master-only** (q6y) — branches never touch it; only master; `merge=union` safety; branch-aware hook.
- **E12 copy fix at the ROOT** — metadata.md spec (not just the asset), so future regen is correct. Reused
  existing agent .md + spec (no new "skill" file) — anti-additivity.
- **E12 overlay = faithful `MY TIME!`** (q9) — keep Director's approved creative, just translate; not a re-author.
- **q8 fire now** (q8a) but deferred to fresh session for quality (long-session risk).
- **q4 portable = git repo + bootstrap, q5 NOT MCP** — keep simple.
- **Dubai time = local `date '+%H:%M'`** — TZ override returns UTC here.

